#       x2[j] += A[i,j] * y_2[i]
#
# For every pair (i, j) this performs the same arithmetic as the
# original two-pass version, but each matrix element A[i,j] is loaded
# only once and reused for both x1 and x2. This halves the matrix
# traffic and improves cache locality for A.
#
# We keep x2 and the y_2 factor consistent with the original formula:
#
#   x2_out[k] = x2[k] + sum_i A[i,k] * y_2[i]
